config DRM_VISUALIZEFX
	tristate "HP VISUALIZE fx5/fx10 (scaffold, non-functional)"
	depends on DRM && PCI
	select DRM_KMS_HELPER
	select DRM_GEM_SHMEM_HELPER
	select I2C
	select I2C_ALGOBIT
	help
	  Scaffold DRM/KMS driver for the HP VISUALIZE fx5/fx10 ("Lego")
	  workstation graphics accelerator (PCI 103c:100a).

	  This is a starting point for a port, NOT a working driver. Mode
	  setting and all hardware programming are unimplemented (see the GAP
	  markers in the source and PORT_PLAN.md). For a usable 2D console on
	  these boards today, the on-card Matrox G200 is handled by the mgag200
	  driver; enable that instead.

	  If unsure, say N.
